id: ops-sdk-settlement-floor
title: Characterize the SDK receipt-history assurance floor
description: "The dependency-only replay of closed PR #151 installs SDK 2026.10.5 on current pm-ops tests. test/ops.test.ts proves that an unaudited markMergeReceiptReconciled settles receipts in that SDK, violating the current audited-history assertion. Main pins SDK 2026.10.10 while manifest.json and npm peer metadata declare the older API floor 2026.8.20. Measure the earliest SDK supporting audited receipt settlement and distinguish the API compatibility floor from the assurance contract before changing declared supported hosts. Preserve the failing historical negative case; do not patch upstream SDK source or relax receipt semantics in this dependency-coupling fix."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-11T06:18:03.801Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-11T07:40:48.966Z"
author: codex-sol-pm-ops
acceptance_criteria: Measure the receipt-history behavior using real disposable trackers across relevant published SDK versions; Document or enforce the assurance floor with unchanged unaudited-settlement refusal
parent: ops-hiee
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-11T07:40:48.966Z",codex-sol-pm-ops,"Historical SDK 2026.10.5 complete Bun gate reproduced an unaudited receipt state mark settling a decision: 579 tests, 576 passed, 1 failed, 2 existing opt-in skips with four 100 coverage measures. The assertion remains unchanged. Current installed SDK 2026.10.10 contains and invokes retainAuditedDurableSettlements and passed the unchanged receipt-history case in all four complete modern gates. The earliest intervening version supporting the assurance contract is not measured; API floor and receipt-history assurance floor remain a distinct follow-up. No upstream source or older-SDK compatibility workaround was implemented.\n"
